00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:49.380
But don't you want to as well?

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:53.380
You and I know about apparitions.

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:54.650
Irrational.

00:07:54.650 --> 00:07:55.800
Absurd.

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:56.990
Illogical.

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:58.230
We know about them.

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:03.270
And that's why, in this case, we feel we want to side with Tsukihi-chan.

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.650
As she is attempting to deny apparitions,

00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:08.290
and sacrificing herself for reality's sake.

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:13.110
Well, yeah, if you put it that way, you may be right,

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:15.840
but then, there's nothing we can do, right?

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:17.530
There's nothing we can do for her, is there?

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:20.560
If you say I have to,

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:25.040
me infiltrating the Tsuganoki Second Middle School's
Tea Ceremony Club is a distinct possibility.

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:26.810
I won't say you have to.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.810
SORRY FOR THE INCONVENIENCE.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.810
WE PUT SAFETY FIRST

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.810
WHILE WE WORK.

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:30.420
Isn't there a good way to tactfully calm Tsukihi down?

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.320
Well, there is one.

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:38.550
If you just want to get Tsukihi-chan in a good mood for the time being, there's a way.

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:42.950
It's not like I'm trying to get her
in a good mood, but there's a way?

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:46.560
However, there's just one problem with this solution.

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:48.150
There's a problem?

00:08:48.150 --> 00:08:50.300
Having a problem's bad.

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:51.820
What kind of a problem is it?

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:55.820
It means that, as a result, you'll be deceiving Tsukihi-chan.

00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:58.470
Hey, Araragi-senpai.

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:02.600
Are you reluctant to lie to your little sisters?

00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:05.830
<i>There's no way I would be.</i>

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:09.790
<i>What you'd call an epilogue, or the punch line for this episode.</i>

00:09:10.470 --> 00:09:12.400
<i>Other than Tsukihi,</i>

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:15.550
<i>why do the Tea Ceremony Club members still
adamantly believe in the "eighth member"?</i>

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:18.730
<i>Even when shown what's correct, even when shown logic,</i>

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:21.180
<i>why are they so emotional about continuing to believe?</i>

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:23.560
<i>Basically, if I could explain that,</i>

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:28.080
<i>that there's a sensible explanation of the absurd, then Tsukihi will be satisfied.</i>

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:30.860
<i>That's why Kanbaru applied logic to it.</i>

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:34.590
<i>"Everyone is continuing to believe
in the 'eighth member' for Tsukihi's sake,"</i>

00:09:35.030 --> 00:09:36.830
<i>is the logic she applied.</i>

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:39.700
<i>Tsukihi often takes supplies from the club room,</i>

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:42.970
<i>such as tea and sweets, without permission.</i>

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:46.580
<i>Well, it's not really that big a deal.</i>

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:50.140
<i>But, strictly speaking, it's not really encouraged, either.</i>

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:55.090
<i>If it became known, club activities may be suspended again.</i>

00:09:55.460 --> 00:09:58.140
<i>That's why, by creating an "eighth member,"</i>

00:09:58.140 --> 00:10:00.470
<i>they justified why their supplies ran out so fast.</i>

00:10:01.110 --> 00:10:05.600
<i>They didn't get their stories straight
ahead of time, but in defense of Tsukihi,</i>

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:09.370
<i>everyone accepted the "eighth member"
of the Tea Ceremony Club.</i>

00:10:09.730 --> 00:10:12.750
So that's it! Everyone did it for me!

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:14.750
<i>The fool was instantly deceived.</i>

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:19.010
And there I was, tactlessly saying that ghosts didn't exist.

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:22.120
My thoughtless attitude itself was the ghost!

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:23.640
<i>That wasn't good at all.</i>

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:25.870
All right, I'll be duped this time!

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:27.250
I'll be duped for their sake.

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:29.020
I'll let them fudge the answer this time.

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:31.890
<i>I relayed what happened to Kanbaru.</i>

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:36.010
The Tea Ceremony Club members or Araragi-senpai...

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:37.130
Which one did Tsukihi-chan decide...

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:40.080
to be fooled by?

00:11:00.650 --> 00:11:06.040
<b>Nayami ketobashite ishi ga korogatte ku</b>

00:11:00.650 --> 00:11:06.040
<b>Kicking a stone as if I was kicking my troubles</b>

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:11.790
<b>Sukoshi gomakashita are wa shigatsu no koto</b>

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:11.790
<b>It was April when I played my trick</b>

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:17.250
<b>Koukishin ousei de akarui kodomo deshita</b>

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:17.250
<b>I was a curious and cheerful child</b>

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:23.010
<b>Senaka oshita no wa ano hi kara no boku de</b>

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:23.010
<b>The me from the past gave me a push</b>

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:28.890
<b>Hamidasenai retsu wo oinuite</b>

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:28.890
<b>Let's loiter on the way</b>

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:34.480
<b>Michikusa wo shiyou</b>

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:34.480
<b>Passing a line you can't even lean out from</b>

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:42.150
<b>Kago ni nose taisetsu na yume</b>

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:42.150
<b>I'll put my precious dreams in the basket</b>

00:11:42.070 --> 00:11:47.530
<b>pedaru mawashi tooku made saa mochi dasou</b>

00:11:42.070 --> 00:11:47.530
<b>and spin the pedals, carrying them far away!</b>

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:52.920
<b>Uwasa shita boku no mirai wa</b>

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:52.920
<b>My rumored future...</b>

00:11:53.170 --> 00:11:54.710
<b>Kokochi iino?</b>

00:11:53.170 --> 00:11:54.710
<b>Am I comfortable with it?</b>

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:58.000
<b>Nobiru kage ni kiitemo</b>

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:58.000
<b>I even asked my long shadow;</b>

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:06.850
<b>Wakaranai wakaranai wakaranai</b>

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:01.050
<b>It doesn't know a thing...</b>

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:03.800
<b>It doesn't know a thing...</b>

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:06.850
<b>It doesn't know a thing...</b>
